---
title: Tomato Salad with Walnut and Pomegranate Molasses
course: Side
locale: en
difficulty: Easy
---

Place the @ripe red tomatoes{2}(cut into ¼” dice with their juices), @walnuts{0.5%cup}(coarsely chopped), @sweet onion{0.5%cup}(cut into fine dice), @flat-leaf parsley{0.25%cup}(finely chopped), @olive oil{2%tbsp}, and @pomegranate molasses{2%tbsp} in a nonreactive mixing bowl. Toss to mix, then season with @coarse salt{} and @black pepper{}(freshly ground) to taste.